dm_guide:
Here's the N+1 fix for Supabase. Instead of looping and querying per row, use a nested select to pull related rows through the foreign key in one call:

const { data } = await supabase.from('posts').select('*, users(name, avatar)')

That's one round trip instead of one query per row. Check the real query count with EXPLAIN ANALYZE in psql. Docs: https://supabase.com/docs/reference/javascript/select and https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-explain.html

