dm_guide:
Here's the fix: never trust a Stripe webhook body directly. In your API route, grab the raw request body (App Router: await request.text(); Pages Router: set bodyParser: false and read the raw stream). Then verify it:

const event = stripe.webhooks.constructEvent(rawBody, request.headers.get('stripe-signature'), process.env.STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET)

Wrap it in a try/catch and return a 400 on failure so Stripe retries. Only grant access after constructEvent succeeds. Docs: https://stripe.com/docs/webhooks/signatures

